		<summary type="html">&lt;div class=&quot;mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output&quot; lang=&quot;it&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:10px; font-size:26px; font-family:Times, Times New Roman, serif, Georgia; color: #ccf;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;“&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:20px; color:black;font-variant:normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:130%;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/span&gt;iate misericordiosi, come è misericordioso il Padre vostro. Non giudicate e non sarete giudicati; non condannate e non sarete condannati; perdonate e vi sarà perdonato; date e vi sarà dato; una buona misura, pigiata, scossa e traboccante vi sarà versata nel grembo, perché con la misura con cui misurate, sarà misurato a voi in cambio.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:10px; font-size:26px; font-family:Times, Times New Roman, serif, Georgia; color: #ccf;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;„&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span typeof=&quot;mw:File&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/wiki/File:David_face.png&quot; class=&quot;mw-file-description&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/David_face.png/40px-David_face.png?utm_source=it.wikiquote.org&amp;amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;amp;utm_content=thumbnail&quot; decoding=&quot;async&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;40&quot; height=&quot;36&quot; class=&quot;mw-file-element&quot; srcset=&quot;//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/David_face.png/120px-David_face.png?utm_source=it.wikiquote.org&amp;amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x&quot; data-file-width=&quot;140&quot; data-file-height=&quot;127&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/wiki/Ges%C3%B9&quot; title=&quot;Gesù&quot;&gt;Gesù&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;i&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/wiki/Vangelo_secondo_Luca&quot; title=&quot;Vangelo secondo Luca&quot;&gt;Vangelo secondo Luca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
